# Copy to .env.test.local, pointing at local Supabase (`supabase start`). Read by packages/db's
# integration tests, the seed script (`pnpm db:seed`), and `pnpm create-tenant` by default. The
# tests and the seed refuse a non-local URL, since they overwrite data.
#
# To create a tenant on a hosted project, put its keys in a separate gitignored file (e.g.
# .env.production.local) and run `pnpm create-tenant ... --env .env.production.local --yes`.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
